      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIVINE INANNA (5) returns from Belmont where she finished seventh in a NMW1Y, having previously raced in a 1 Metro Win. This is a more suitable assignment, offering helpful weight relief, and her two wins from three starts at this track and distance highlight her suitability. ORACLE SON (4) poses a major threat after defeating several rivals first-up here, scoring by a neck against Snippy Sean despite being an outsider. Rates highly on the back of that effort and there's no reason why he can't go on with the job. ONEMORETWOMANY (2) finished just behind ORACLE SON last start while racing wide and has the 1200m record to remain a contender if he replicates that performance. SPARKLE CORNER (6) returns from a long break with a solid trial second and showed promise at this venue last campaign, making him a fresh contender who could add value if fit enough. PRINCE RAGNAR (1) can give a bold sight from the front.",
